{"4755250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ROMUL", "steam_appid": 4755250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes and Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have access to 3 character classes: <strong>Medic, Soldier, and Engineer</strong>. Use each class's unique equipment to successfully complete your assigned objectives. Will you all go in as medics, or will you balance your squad? Use a microphone and webcam, if you have one, to communicate with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f7b954a3a3e6a9e3b319dd7c958c8288.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f7b954a3a3e6a9e3b319dd7c958c8288.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f7b954a3a3e6a9e3b319dd7c958c8288.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assistant Robot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hostile conditions, you will be helped by a robot that speaks every language. It is a rather old robot with early-stage AI from the beginning of the 21st century. Back then, they still could not fully replace a friend or get you fired from your job, but they could follow voice commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f94d1878336ccde4d0acce1fd2c19a5f.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f94d1878336ccde4d0acce1fd2c19a5f.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f94d1878336ccde4d0acce1fd2c19a5f.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On some stations, accidents have caused the anti-gravity cores to malfunction. In some places you will have to fly without gravity, and in others you will walk on the ceiling or even the walls. For special cases, the company has issued you a <strong>Zero-G tool</strong> that shoots anti-gravity spheres: you will be able to lift equipment, valuables, monsters, and even friends into the air and secure them with cables... Improvise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/0de523451f71b230b431fe8e213c8504.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/0de523451f71b230b431fe8e213c8504.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/0de523451f71b230b431fe8e213c8504.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters and Hazards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiments were once conducted on the stations we visit, and their results became all kinds of monsters, from military bio-robots to animated organic substance. Use gravity features, weapons, and hiding places to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/76e1aeaa328f31f8100ef02c2c7f140d.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/76e1aeaa328f31f8100ef02c2c7f140d.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/76e1aeaa328f31f8100ef02c2c7f140d.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valuables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take every valuable item from the station that you can reach, but be careful: many of them may be more active than you think. Sell items at the base to unlock access to new stations and new, more powerful equipment. Medkits, weapons, and other tools will be available to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/13acebcfa010178008d3c29a8d3e36ab.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/13acebcfa010178008d3c29a8d3e36ab.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/13acebcfa010178008d3c29a8d3e36ab.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural Generation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every station is unique and one of a kind: they are assembled from a wide variety of rooms, many of which can be interactive or even dangerous, such as a laser room or a compartment that dumps trash into endless space. You will have no map and no way to memorize a single route: become an explorer of the unknown!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/120aba6810a46345fdfe76217cb9e95a.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/120aba6810a46345fdfe76217cb9e95a.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/120aba6810a46345fdfe76217cb9e95a.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore stations in co-op with your friends.</li><li>Set your own image or use a webcam instead of the frog avatar's face.</li><li>Communicate through voice chat and radio.</li><li>Upload your own music to the lobby and items.</li><li>Assistant robot with storage, voice control, and its own AI voice.</li><li>Unstable gravity that sometimes makes you play while flying or upside down.</li><li>Anti-gravity tools that help you in different situations.</li><li>Different types of threats: monsters, destroyed sectors, and trap rooms.</li><li>Procedural generation of stations from pre-made sections.</li><li>Many interactive items.</li><li>A shop with support tools and upgrades.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes and Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have access to 3 character classes: <strong>Medic, Soldier, and Engineer</strong>. Use each class's unique equipment to successfully complete your assigned objectives. Will you all go in as medics, or will you balance your squad? Use a microphone and webcam, if you have one, to communicate with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f7b954a3a3e6a9e3b319dd7c958c8288.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f7b954a3a3e6a9e3b319dd7c958c8288.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f7b954a3a3e6a9e3b319dd7c958c8288.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Assistant Robot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hostile conditions, you will be helped by a robot that speaks every language. It is a rather old robot with early-stage AI from the beginning of the 21st century. Back then, they still could not fully replace a friend or get you fired from your job, but they could follow voice commands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f94d1878336ccde4d0acce1fd2c19a5f.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f94d1878336ccde4d0acce1fd2c19a5f.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/f94d1878336ccde4d0acce1fd2c19a5f.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On some stations, accidents have caused the anti-gravity cores to malfunction. In some places you will have to fly without gravity, and in others you will walk on the ceiling or even the walls. For special cases, the company has issued you a <strong>Zero-G tool</strong> that shoots anti-gravity spheres: you will be able to lift equipment, valuables, monsters, and even friends into the air and secure them with cables... Improvise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/0de523451f71b230b431fe8e213c8504.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/0de523451f71b230b431fe8e213c8504.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/0de523451f71b230b431fe8e213c8504.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monsters and Hazards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiments were once conducted on the stations we visit, and their results became all kinds of monsters, from military bio-robots to animated organic substance. Use gravity features, weapons, and hiding places to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/76e1aeaa328f31f8100ef02c2c7f140d.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/76e1aeaa328f31f8100ef02c2c7f140d.webm?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/76e1aeaa328f31f8100ef02c2c7f140d.mp4?t=1787572642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Valuables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take every valuable item from the station that you can reach, but be careful: many of them may be more active than you think. Sell items at the base to unlock access to new stations and new, more powerful equipment. Medkits, weapons, and other tools will be available to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4755250/extras/13acebcfa010178008d3c29a8d3e36ab.poster.avif?t=1787572642\" width=1170 height=340 ><so